{"reviewId": "380402079_80P7KKESp", "review": {"abstract": "1948年开始，资本主义世界进入为期近20年的长波繁荣期，为战后日本经济复苏提供了一个绝佳的外部环境，也使日本在政策和主导产业选择上更为主动。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "chapterUid": 12, "content": "日本和我国不一样，从1948年开始，就是二战以后，世界经济周期开始走向复苏和繁荣，日本也是从这个时候开始经济腾飞的，以电力，重工，机器为主导。基本上发展了20年；我国基本上是从九十年代以后开始发展的，刚好处于这个波长的衰退期。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "17593-17664", "createTime": 1749624760, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "380402079_80P7KKESp", "userVid": 380402079, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 12, "chapterTitle": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "author": {"userVid": 380402079, "name": "@雁菁💞", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-YP88sMnDO5fc6f~Xb7tXUf6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "@雁菁💞", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "文字中谋心，阅读中谋趣，烟火中谋生。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "人丑就要多读书，腹有诗书气自华。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 414458585, "name": "🌲", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-qHEk9NbwnipEQVkzI37JJ10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 7, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "又有谁的